/**
 * The v7 painted art, generated by the studio with FLUX.1 [schnell] (Apache-2.0) on a public Hugging Face Space, and cut out with
 * BiRefNet (MIT). Zero money; the outputs are ours and dedicated CC0 (assets/LICENSES.json).
 *   node scripts/gen-art.mjs [only-id ...]      → assets/art-src/*.webp (raw) → public/art/*.webp (sized, cut out)
 * Re-running skips files that already exist (delete one to regenerate it). Seeds are fixed so the set is reproducible.
 */
